archdoc/list-tight-after-open-fence document/list[0] goldmark reads a list as loose where blank lines fall inside an item's unclosed fence
archdoc/list-tight-definition-in-item document/list[0] goldmark reads a list as loose where an item opens with a link reference definition followed by a lazy line
