archdoc/footnote-label-with-escaped-bracket document/paragraph[0]/link[0] goldmark reads a footnote label holding an escaped ], where the reference reads a link to a link reference definition
archdoc/footnote-label-ending-in-escaped-backslash document goldmark reads a backslash before ] in a footnote label as escaping it where the backslash is itself escaped, so reads a footnote definition where the reference reads a paragraph
archdoc/footnote-reference-after-bang-before-parentheses document/paragraph[0]/link[0] goldmark reads [^1] after ! and before a destination as a footnote reference, where the reference reads a link
archdoc/html-block-opening-footnote-definition document/footnote_definition[0]/html_block[0] goldmark keeps the space after a footnote definition's colon in an HTML block that opens the definition
archdoc/code-span-on-a-lazy-line document/block_quote[0]/paragraph[0]/code[0] the reference keeps the leading space of a lazy line within a code span, which goldmark and commonmark.js remove
archdoc/fence-info-ending-in-entity-space document/code_block[0] the reference drops a space written as an entity at the end of a fence's info string, which goldmark and commonmark.js keep

